# MMG

Social copilot for a live conversation. Not a chatbox. The live agent is **Mac**.

Read `docs/SHIP.md` then `AGENTS.md` before nontrivial edits.

P0: Live E2E is up. Directives: `docs/SHIP.md`. Target 5s: `docs/SCORING.md`.
Lisa: first+last enroll + tape. Jake: confirm Exa/skip on a full name. Luis: live ledger + hide Recall Jake. Re-encounter is on the tape (spoken name, not face).

- **Lisa** owns GPT Live (`web/src/lib/live/**`, `/api/session`, `/api/delegate`). Stay out of Exa while Jake has it.
- **Luis** owns the whisper-card UI (`web/src/app/page.tsx`).
- **Jake** owns `web/src/lib/memory/**` + Exa write-back.
- **Saint** owns `client/mentra/**` and `/glasses` (P2 — do not block P0).

Do not mix lanes. Shared types only in `web/src/lib/types.ts`.

Never: send glasses video to GPT Live; block Live on Exa/treg/Hermes; face-match strangers; invent people; commit `.env`; add Auth0.

Always: client delegation; browser mic works without glasses; `brief` <150 ms local; UI card is ground truth if voice paraphrases.

Hermes is a **time ripcord** (`docs/HERMES.md`). Default `HERMES_ENABLED=0`. Pull it (do not connect hall) if the clock is tight. C3=5 is local Exa kill/skip.
